```

```cs
int expectedIndex = Old_index + 1;
Debug.Assert(New_arrListIndexOfX <= expectedIndex && New_arrListIndexOfX >= expectedIndex - Old_arrListCount); // @@@ arrList.Insert(index, x) increased index of x
```

```cs
